JK,Episode\JK1.GOB,misc/cogstrings.uni,uni,130,inline,Goal 2,"""GOAL_10002""   0  ""Interrupt the reactor flow and take the lower vents into the shuttle bay.  8t88 shouldn't be far.""",,,,,
