JK,Episode\JK1CTF.GOB,cog/c3_fanspuzzle.cog,cog,9,full,"First, a huge fan is blowing air horizontally.",,,,,,
JK,Episode\JK1CTF.GOB,cog/c3_fanspuzzle.cog,cog,10,full,If it is stopped -- this happens at random times -- a 'signal_sc',,,commented_code,,,
