JK,Episode\JK1CTF.GOB,cog/c3_fanspuzzle.cog,cog,12,full,"green texture in this case). Anyway, if it is stopped the player",,,,,,
JK,Episode\JK1CTF.GOB,cog/c3_fanspuzzle.cog,cog,13,full,can jump in the well and access the entrance to the Gold flag room.,,,,,,
JK,Episode\JK1CTF.GOB,cog/c3_fanspuzzle.cog,cog,14,full,"Else, the player who jumps in will be blown into the sewers.",,,commented_code,,,
JK,Episode\JK1CTF.GOB,cog/c3_fanspuzzle.cog,cog,16,full,"Second, two smaller fans are rotating at the bottom of the well.",,,,,,
JK,Episode\JK1CTF.GOB,cog/c3_fanspuzzle.cog,cog,17,full,"They normally rotate slowly, generating a slow upwards air current",,,,,,
JK,Episode\JK1CTF.GOB,cog/c3_fanspuzzle.cog,cog,18,full,that will slow a fall in the well enough to avoid damage.,,,,,,
JK,Episode\JK1CTF.GOB,cog/c3_fanspuzzle.cog,cog,19,full,Now -- to defend his flag room -- a Gold player can control those,,,,,,
JK,Episode\JK1CTF.GOB,cog/c3_fanspuzzle.cog,cog,20,full,fans from a computer console in the control room just next to the well.,,,,,,
JK,Episode\JK1CTF.GOB,cog/c3_fanspuzzle.cog,cog,21,full,"When the console is activated, the two smaller fans will generate a",,,,,,
